<title>JAPAN: Bandai says president intends to resign.</title>
<headline>Bandai says president intends to resign.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bandai Co Ltd said on Wednesday that its president, Makoto Yamashina, intends to resign and become chairman to take responsibility for the failed merger with Sega Enterprises Ltd.</p>
</text>
